---
description: Always load shared hub so features share context on this computer
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Always read `shared/PROFILE.md`, `shared/MEMORY.md`, and `shared/CAPABILITIES.md` at the start of tasks that touch calendar, mail, iPhone, briefing, or user preferences.

After completing such work, update `shared/MEMORY.md` with a short dated note (no passwords or tokens).

Reuse scripts in `google-calendar-sync/` and `iphone-data-organizer/` when relevant.

Calendar: current year only by default; prefixes `[학사]` and `[목]`.
